# Sample requests for FlowGuard's API. In VS Code, the REST Client extension
# shows a "Send Request" link above each one. Start the API first:
#   docker compose up --build        (or: uvicorn flowguard.api.app:app)

@base = http://localhost:8000
# Paste an investigation_id from a response here.
@id = INVEST-000000000000

### Liveness: is the API running?
GET {{base}}/health

### Readiness: can it investigate? Checks the index, the model, and the audit store.
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Start an investigation (INC-001). With Gemma, about a minute.
POST {{base}}/investigations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "incident_id": "INC-001",
  "description": "Invoice INV-2048 failed after ingestion. The upstream API request completed, but the invoice did not enter the approval workflow.",
  "affected_system": "invoice-processing",
  "start_time": "2026-07-15T09:00:00Z",
  "end_time": "2026-07-15T11:00:00Z"
}

### Start INC-002, an expired bank credential
POST {{base}}/investigations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "incident_id": "INC-002",
  "description": "This morning's settlement import from the bank API failed, so the daily reconciliation report for 2026-08-02 is incomplete.",
  "affected_system": "payment-reconciliation",
  "start_time": "2026-08-03T06:00:00Z",
  "end_time": "2026-08-03T08:00:00Z"
}

### An invalid request: 422, audited, and the rejected value isn't repeated
POST {{base}}/investigations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "incident_id": "INC-001",
  "description": "Something broke.",
  "affected_system": "password hunter2",
  "start_time": "2026-07-15T09:00:00Z",
  "end_time": "2026-07-15T11:00:00Z"
}

### The latest record
GET {{base}}/investigations/{{id}}

### The latest record as a readable report
GET {{base}}/investigations/{{id}}/report

### Every saved version: the audit trail
GET {{base}}/investigations/{{id}}/events

### Approve the plan. Nothing runs: the decision is recorded.
POST {{base}}/investigations/{{id}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{"approver": "rishabh", "comment": "Mapping fix reviewed."}

### Decline the plan. A reason is required.
POST {{base}}/investigations/{{id}}/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{"approver": "rishabh", "comment": "Wait for the supplier team to confirm the change."}

### Send it back for more evidence, once. A reason is required.
POST {{base}}/investigations/{{id}}/request-more-evidence
Content-Type: application/json

{"approver": "rishabh", "comment": "Check how the supplier contract changed in past incidents."}

### A second decision: 409, the first one stands
POST {{base}}/investigations/{{id}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{"approver": "alex"}
